<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal calls 25 bln esc, 7-yr bond tender.</title>
<headline>Portugal calls 25 bln esc, 7-yr bond tender.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese Treasury said it would auction 25 billion escudos of seven-year, variable-rate bonds December 16.</p>
<p>The bonds are indexed to the six-month Lisbor rate, less 25 basis points. Payment is on December 23 and the bonds expire August 15, 2003.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
